/*
  Welcome.strings
  Wherever

  简体中文
*/

"Welcome to Wherever" = "欢迎使用 Wherever";
"Full Disk Access lets Wherever see every folder on this Mac, so it can find any file." = "完全磁盘访问权限让 Wherever 可以查看这台 Mac 上的每个文件夹，从而找到任何文件。";
"Wherever reads file names, sizes and dates, and in Normal mode the words inside your files. Nothing leaves your Mac." = "Wherever 读取文件名、大小和日期；在“标准”模式下，还会读取文件里的文字。不会有任何内容离开你的 Mac。";
"Under Privacy & Security, Full Disk Access, turn on Wherever." = "在“隐私与安全”的“完全磁盘访问权限”中，打开 Wherever。";
"Quit and reopen Wherever so it can search every folder." = "退出 Wherever 并重新打开，它就能搜索每个文件夹。";
"Open System Settings" = "打开系统设置";
"Let's Go!" = "开始吧！";
"Full Disk Access is on. Wherever is ready to start." = "完全磁盘访问权限已开启。Wherever 已准备好启动。";
"Full Disk Access is still off. In System Settings > Privacy & Security > Full Disk Access, turn on this copy of Wherever." = "完全磁盘访问权限仍未开启。请在“系统设置”>“隐私与安全”>“完全磁盘访问权限”中，开启此 Wherever 副本的权限。";
"Wherever could not check Full Disk Access. It will try again. If this continues, quit and reopen Wherever." = "Wherever 无法检查完全磁盘访问权限，将重试。如果问题持续，请退出 Wherever 并重新打开。";
"System Settings could not open. Open it from the Apple menu, then choose Privacy & Security > Full Disk Access." = "无法打开系统设置。请从苹果菜单打开，然后选择“隐私与安全”>“完全磁盘访问权限”。";
"Wherever could not start its search. Quit and reopen Wherever, then try again." = "Wherever 无法启动搜索。请退出 Wherever 并重新打开，然后重试。";
"Welcome to Wherever!" = "欢迎使用 Wherever！";
"Wherever it is, find it." = "无论在哪儿，都能找到。";
"Back" = "返回";
"Next" = "下一步";
"Choose Your Mode" = "选择模式";
"You can change it later in the View menu." = "之后可以在“显示”菜单中更改。";
"Set Up Wherever" = "设置 Wherever";
"You can change these later in Settings." = "之后可以在设置中更改这些选项。";
"Launcher shortcut" = "启动器快捷键";
"You’re All Set" = "一切就绪";
"Step %lld of %lld" = "第 %1$lld 步，共 %2$lld 步";
